---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us — Fall Asleep" description="Learn about the mission behind Fall Asleep, your privacy-first nightly companion for better rest.">
  <main class="page-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
      <h1>About Us</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="page-content">
      <p>Welcome to <strong>Fall Asleep</strong>.</p>
      <p>Our mission is simple: to help you find real rest in an increasingly distracted world. We understand that lying awake at night with racing thoughts can be incredibly frustrating. That's why we built a suite of scientifically-backed tools—like Cognitive Shuffling and guided breathing—designed to naturally calm your nervous system and help you transition into deep sleep.</p>
      <h2>Privacy First</h2>
      <p>We believe your sleep habits and nighttime thoughts are deeply personal. Unlike many other sleep apps, Fall Asleep is built with a strict privacy-first architecture. <strong>All data stays locally on your device.</strong> We do not require accounts, we do not sync your data to the cloud, and we do not track your usage. Your rest belongs to you.</p>
      <h2>Designed for the Dark</h2>
      <p>Every element of this application has been carefully crafted to preserve your night vision. Our deep dark themes, muted accents, and lack of jarring animations ensure that using this app in the middle of the night won't stimulate your brain with unnecessary blue light.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>


